# Spiritual Gangster
> Spiritual Gangster is a yoga-inspired activewear and lifestyle brand founded in 2008 by yoga instructors Vanessa Lee and Ian Lopatin. It designs women's and men's activewear, loungewear, graphic tees, and accessories rooted in the philosophy of high-vibration living. For every item sold, the brand donates to Feeding America (15+ million meals donated to date). Acquired by Unified Commerce Group in December 2023. Ships across the US and internationally via its website and 200+ wholesale partners worldwide.

This file helps language models understand Spiritual Gangster's most important pages. Pages are ordered by priority within each section. Product collections and the blog drive the majority of discovery.

## Core Brand Pages
- [Homepage](https://spiritualgangster.com/): Main storefront with full women's and men's category navigation, featured shops, and current collections
- [Our Story](https://spiritualgangster.com/pages/our-story): Brand origin story, founding philosophy, community mission, and giving-back initiatives with Feeding America

## Women's Collections
- [All Women's Activewear](https://spiritualgangster.com/collections/sg-womens-activewear): Full women's range including leggings, sports bras, tanks, tops, and sweatshirts
- [Women's Leggings & Bottoms](https://spiritualgangster.com/collections/womens-activewear-bottoms): Yoga leggings, bike shorts, and activewear bottoms
- [Graphic Tanks & Tees](https://spiritualgangster.com/collections/tanks-tees): SG's signature spiritual and affirmation-based graphic tops; the product the brand was built on
- [Women's Sweatshirts & Hoodies](https://spiritualgangster.com/collections/sweatshirts): Loungewear-crossover sweatshirts and hoodies
- [Seamless Activewear](https://spiritualgangster.com/collections/seamless-activewear): Ultra-stretch seamless leggings, bras, and tanks suited for yoga andlow-impact movement
- [Lounge](https://spiritualgangster.com/collections/lounge): Soft separates and sets for off-mat and everyday wear

## Men's Collections
- [All Men's](https://spiritualgangster.com/collections/men): Full men's range across clothing and activewear
- [Men's New Arrivals](https://spiritualgangster.com/collections/mens-new-arrivals): Latest men's drops across tops, bottoms, and sweatshirts
- [Men's Tops](https://spiritualgangster.com/collections/mens-tops): Graphic tees, tanks, and casual tops for men
- [Men's Bottoms](https://spiritualgangster.com/collections/mens-bottoms): Sweatpants, shorts, and activewear bottoms for men

## Blog
- [Angel Numbers Guide](https://spiritualgangster.com/blogs/news/angel-numbers): Master guide to angel numbers 111 through 999 with spiritual meaning and affirmations for each
- [Dress for Your Astrology Sign](https://spiritualgangster.com/blogs/news/dress-for-your-sign): Style guide matching SG product recommendations to each zodiac sign's aesthetic and energy
- [222: Angel Number of Alignment](https://spiritualgangster.com/blogs/news/222-angel-number-of-alignment): Editorial on the meaning of angel number 222 and its spiritual significance
- [888: Angel Number of Abundance](https://spiritualgangster.com/blogs/news/888-angel-number-of-abundance): Editorial on angel number 888, abundance, and manifestation
- [Reawaken the Goddess Within](https://spiritualgangster.com/blogs/news/reawaken-the-goddess-within): Wellness and spirituality editorial on feminine energy and self-reconnection
- [Balancing the Heart Chakra](https://spiritualgangster.com/blogs/news/balancing-the-heart-chakra): Guide to heart chakra healing practices
- [The Anti-Travel Guide: Big Sur](https://spiritualgangster.com/blogs/news/anti-travel-guide-big-sur): Mindful travel editorial on Big Sur, California

